---
import Marketing from "../layouts/Marketing.astro";
import { SITE } from "../lib/site";
---
<Marketing title="Community" description="Contribute to Goshikq on GitHub. Apache 2.0, no AI co-authors, honest implementation status." path="/community/">
  <section class="hero wrap prose">
    <p class="kicker">Community</p>
    <h1>Work in the open</h1>
    <p>Maintainer: <a href={SITE.maintainer}>goshikavs</a>. There is no Discord or Slack. GitHub issues and pull requests are the coordination channel.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href={SITE.github}>Repository</a></li>
      <li><a href={`${SITE.github}/issues`}>Issues</a></li>
      <li><a href={SITE.contributingUrl}>Contributing</a></li>
      <li><a href={SITE.securityUrl}>Security policy</a></li>
      <li><a href="/docs/status/">Implementation status</a></li>
      <li><a href="/docs/changelog/">Changelog</a></li>
      <li><a href="/docs/roadmap/">Roadmap</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Do not add AI assistants as authors or co-authors. Do not mark planned features as available.</p>
  </section>
</Marketing>
